WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.399
"We must tell Cow," said Cat.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.239
"We must tell her about the monster!"

3
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:16.816
"I will stay here," said Dog.

4
00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:20.420
"I will watch the farm."

5
00:00:20.421 --> 00:00:28.934
Cat and Pig ran back to the barn.

6
00:00:28.935 --> 00:00:38.261
"Dog saw a monster!" said Pig.

7
00:00:38.262 --> 00:00:43.177
"It was black!" said Cat.

8
00:00:43.178 --> 00:00:47.294
"It was big!" said Pig.

9
00:00:47.295 --> 00:00:50.429
"What did it do?" Cow asked.

10
00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:54.498
"It ate Red Bird's food!" said Pig.

11
00:00:54.499 --> 00:00:57.343
"Oh!" said Cow.

12
00:00:57.344 --> 00:01:02.156
"That's just the bear.

13
00:01:02.157 --> 00:01:08.733
The bear came last year too."

14
00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:12.825
"Dog barked," said Cat.

15
00:01:12.826 --> 00:01:14.972
"And it ran away.

16
00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:18.372
But it might come back!"

17
00:01:18.373 --> 00:01:21.710
"Yes," said Cow.

18
00:01:21.711 --> 00:01:23.868
"It might come back.

19
00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:26.580
But I have a plan."

20
00:01:26.581 --> 00:01:30.579
"What is your plan?" asked Pig.

21
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:36.901
"We will look for blueberries!" said Cow.

